1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:05,000
Maya and Leo had been best friends since childhood, bound by a love for adventure,

2
00:00:05,000 --> 00:00:11,000
and an unspoken promise to always be there for each other. One rainy evening, after years apart

3
00:00:11,000 --> 00:00:16,000
chasing their own dreams, they found themselves sitting together at an empty train station.

4
00:00:17,000 --> 00:00:21,000
The last train home was delayed, and the world around them was quiet,

5
00:00:21,000 --> 00:00:26,000
except for the tapping of rain on the roof. They talked about everything and nothing,

6
00:00:26,000 --> 00:00:32,000
about mistakes, victories, fears, and hopes. Somewhere between laughter and silence,

7
00:00:32,000 --> 00:00:37,000
they realized that no matter how much time had passed, nothing important had changed.

8
00:00:38,000 --> 00:00:42,000
When the train finally arrived, they stepped aboard together, side by side,

9
00:00:43,000 --> 00:00:54,000
knowing that true friendship doesn't get lost. It just waits for the next chapter.

